     * Handles {@link InvalidOwnerFieldsException} raised when an owner payload is missing or blank
     * in one or more required fields. Returns a 400 Bad Request whose body carries an {@code errors}
     * array listing the name of each offending field.
     *
     * @param e The {@link InvalidOwnerFieldsException} to be handled
     * @param request {@link HttpServletRequest} object referring to the current request.
     * @return A {@link ResponseEntity} containing the error information and a 400 Bad Request status.
